>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYDUP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE                     PIC X(512).
01 SOURCE-SEEN                    PIC X.
01 COMMERCIAL-SIMILAR             PIC X.
01 CURRENT-CYCLE-REF              PIC X.
01 HISTORY-STATUS                 PIC X(16).
01 OUTPUT-CODE                    PIC X(32).
01 FIELD-COUNT                    PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO SOURCE-SEEN COMMERCIAL-SIMILAR CURRENT-CYCLE-REF HISTORY-STATUS
        COUNT IN FIELD-COUNT
    END-UNSTRING
    MOVE "NEW" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    IF SOURCE-SEEN = "Y" OR COMMERCIAL-SIMILAR = "Y"
        MOVE "DUPLICATE" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    END-IF
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(OUTPUT-CODE)
    STOP RUN.
